.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.zip
node_modules/
.env
.claude/
/sponsors/

# Local Netlify folder
.netlify

# Full-res photo originals from the club shoot (~40MB). The optimised
# derivatives in img/players/ are what ship; these are the archive.
_source/

# Internal briefs, audits and setup notes. NOT site content, and several
# contain the staff PIN and references to service keys. This is a PUBLIC repo.
*.md
!README.md

# The constitution. These three govern every product decision and MUST be
# inherited by whoever runs the club next — a constitution that lives on one
# laptop is a private opinion, not a framework. They contain no secrets.
#   THE-LANE.md  why the club exists · rituals, culture, institutional memory
#   VISION.md    the principles we refuse to compromise
#   ROADMAP.md   the practical route, organised by information lifecycle
!THE-LANE.md
!VISION.md
!ROADMAP.md

# docs/ is documentation that SHIPS — standards and runbooks volunteers actually
# use, and the handover notes a future maintainer inherits (ROADMAP.md F4).
# The internal briefs at the repo root stay ignored; those are working notes and
# some name credentials. Nothing in docs/ may contain a secret.
!docs/
!docs/**
